  m_text: 'TalkJourney is a student game project created for our college studies
    by Reuven Itzhakov and Peleg Canfi.

    Built to explore interactive storytelling
    and conversation-driven gameplay, it combines simple, approachable mechanics
    with thoughtful narrative moments.

    Made with Unity - thanks for playing
    and for any feedback.

'
